  "body": "Offering comfortable, low-maintenance living, this three-bedroom home is an appealing option for first-home buyers, downsizers, families, retirees or investors.\r\n\r\nThe practical floor plan provides three bedrooms, a well-positioned bathroom and comfortable everyday living without the burden of a large property to maintain. Its generous floor area also gives the home a sense of space that can be difficult to find in this price range.\r\n\r\nSet in an established Orewa neighbourhood, the property is conveniently located within easy walking distance of local shops, schools, transport links and Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for your first step onto the property ladder, an easier home to look after or a well-located addition to your investment portfolio, 1/2 Doment Crescent deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nEasy to enjoy, simple to maintain and conveniently positioned -  come and discover the opportunity for yourself. Call Lane today.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this information has been sourced from third parties. View our property information disclaimer here: raineandhorne.co.nz/property-disclaimer",
